## 先加 API 取得代码

建议放在你已经登录成功、进入 Usage 页面之后，也就是 `[8]` 前后都可以。

加下面这一段：

```powershell
# ========================================
# AI Services Usage API データ取得
# ========================================

Write-Host "[8] AI Services Usage API データを取得します"


$apiResult =
    Invoke-MarionetteScript `
        -Stream $stream `
        -Script @'
const done = arguments[arguments.length - 1];

fetch(
    "/dip/api/admin/ai-services/credits-status",
    {
        method: "GET",
        credentials: "same-origin"
    }
)
.then(response => {

    if (!response.ok) {
        throw new Error(
            "HTTP " +
            response.status +
            " " +
            response.statusText
        );
    }

    return response.json();
})
.then(data => {

    done({
        success: true,
        data: data
    });

})
.catch(error => {

    done({
        success: false,
        error: error.toString()
    });

});
'@
```

不过这里有一点：这是异步 JS，Marionette 最好使用 `ExecuteAsyncScript`。所以建议我们加一个新的函数：

```powershell
function Invoke-MarionetteAsyncScript {
    param(
        [System.IO.Stream]$Stream,
        [string]$Script,
        [object[]]$Arguments = @()
    )

    $result =
        Invoke-MarionetteCommand `
            -Stream $Stream `
            -Command "WebDriver:ExecuteAsyncScript" `
            -Parameters @{
                script = $Script
                args = $Arguments
                newSandbox = $true
                sandbox = "default"
                line = 0
                filename = "DataikuAutomation.ps1"
            }

    if ($null -ne $result.value) {
        return $result.value
    }

    return $result
}
```

然后 API 部分用：

```powershell
$apiResult =
    Invoke-MarionetteAsyncScript `
        -Stream $stream `
        -Script @'
const done = arguments[arguments.length - 1];

fetch(
    "/dip/api/admin/ai-services/credits-status",
    {
        method: "GET",
        credentials: "same-origin"
    }
)
.then(response => {

    if (!response.ok) {
        throw new Error(
            "HTTP " +
            response.status +
            " " +
            response.statusText
        );
    }

    return response.json();
})
.then(data => {

    done({
        success: true,
        data: data
    });

})
.catch(error => {

    done({
        success: false,
        error: error.toString()
    });

});
'@
```

然后保存：

```powershell
if (-not $apiResult.success) {
    throw "AI Services Usage API の取得に失敗しました: $($apiResult.error)"
}


$JsonPath = "C:\temp\dataiku_ai_services_usage.json"


$apiResult.data |
    ConvertTo-Json -Depth 20 |
    Set-Content `
        -Path $JsonPath `
        -Encoding UTF8


Write-Host "    API データ保存完了:"
Write-Host "    $JsonPath"
```

这样你就会得到：

```text
C:\temp\dataiku_usage.png
C:\temp\dataiku_ai_services_usage.json
```

